<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">FILEMONI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ya Pauli kwa Filemoni</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filemoni</para>
  <para style="toc3">File</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filemoni</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ya Pauli kwa Filemoni</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongolyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu si'no kisene kwa Filemoni saandikilwe na Ntumilwe Pauli (1:1). Pauli paandike abile muutabilwe, likowe lya ngama ibonekana panga pakiandike aabile kumuyi wa Roma. Na manaitei kakape abile Roma pakiandikage bai yendawesekana panga saandikilwe mumwaka 61 bu'ka po belekwa kwa Yesu Kilisitu. Kai' kitabu sa Akolosai nasembe saandikilwe mumwaka wo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pauli aamwandiki balua yi' mundu yumo ywakemelwa Filemoni. Filemoni aai mumini wa kanisa ywaabile kai' ntawala wa abanda. Pauli aamwandiki balua yi' Filemoni li'nga kunnu'ba kaneampwati mmanda wake Onesimo ywaantolwike apo pasu'gu'. Kwa salya ya Kiroma Filemoni abile nayo aki ya kummulaga Onesimo. Pauli atumya mayi'gi'yo gene usopi li'nga kunnyi'ya mwoyo Filemoni annyi'ki'ti Onesimo kati nnongowe mu Kilisitu, na ata yongeya panga ayi'ki'tilwe panga mpangakasi pamope nakwe Pauli mwene (1:13).</para>
  <para style="iot">Mutasali</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Pauli endakunsalimia Filemoni <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Pauli endalu'ba paali pa Onesimo panga Filemoni annyi'ki'ti kati nnongowe mu Kilisitu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:4-21">1:4-21</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Pauli ayomolya balua yake kwo awanikiya mabinio gake ga kuntyangilya Filemoni no lagya salamu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:22-25">1:22-25</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Nenga na Pauli na ntabilwe kwa kitumbu sa Kilisitu Yesu, na Timoteo nnongo witu, tukuandikya wa Filemoni waupendilwe, wampanga kasi nnyitu, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />na kwa dada bitu ywapendilwe Afia, kwa Akilipa ywatuyangatiana nakwe ku'mbwana ngondo ya imani, na kwa likanisa lyalikwembana panyumba yako.<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Ngu'ngu' na amani bu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu' Tati' bitu na kwa Bwana Yesu Kilisitu ibe pamope na mwenga.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upendo na imani ya Filemoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Kila panikulu'bya ninsukulu Nnu'ngu', <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />kwa mwanjaa niyu'wa abali ya imani yako kwa Bwana Yesu na upendo wako kwa aumini boti. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Nilu'ba Nnu'ngu' li'nga imani yaubile nayo wenga na twenga ikuyangatiye tanga muno balaka yoti yatupata nkati ya Kilisitu. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Wannongo wangu', utenipulaisa na kunikangamaya muno, kwa mwanjaa myoyo ya bandu ba Nnu'ngu' ipatike makakala gayambi' bu'kana na upendo wako.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilu'bo kwa Onesimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Kwa nyo, pamope no panga kwa Kilisitu nilu'e wesa baa na amuli yo lagya galu' gaupalikwa kugapanga, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />lakini bu'kana na upendo nikulu'ba upange nya. Nenga na Pauli nambi'yambi' nanng'oi, kai' na ntabilwe kwa kitumbu sa Kilisitu Yesu, <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />nikulu'ba kwa kitumbu sa mwana wangu' Onesimo, ywanampatike muimani panaabile muutabilwe. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Patumbu ywembe aakupwaikeli, lakini nambi'yambi' akupwaika wenga na nenga kai'.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Pamope no panga nitekumpenda kwa mwoyo wangu' woti, lakini nambi'yambi' ninki'li'bu'ya kasako. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Naapendile ayendeli tama nanenga pano li'nga akamwe lipala lyako lya kuniyangatia kwa nsimu wu'no wanibile muutabilwe kwa kitumbu sa Abali Inannoga. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Lakini naapangali likowe lyolyoti pangali kuliyi'ki'tya wenga, li'nga unogau wowoti waupanga kaneube wa kukuli'ndi'ndya, ila kwo penda wamwene.<verse eid="PHM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Pi'ngi' si'no nga kitumbu so talukana nakwe Onesimo kwa masu'ba masene bai, li'nga upate baa nakwe kai' milele. <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />Nambi'yambi' kati mmanda bai lili, ila ywembe ywa ngama pi'ta mmanda, kati nnongo ywapendilwe kwangu' na kasako muno. Kai', ywembe kati mmanda bai lili, ila kai' kati yumo ywitu twatubile kwa Bwana.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Bai, manaitei utangite panga nenga nannyino muimani, umpoki Onesimo kati mu'lu' mwaulu'e kunipokya nenga namwene. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Mana aakukosile likowe lyolyoti au unnonga kili'be sosoti, unilonge nenga. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Nsisingwa wu'no wa kuundi'la niandika nenga na Pauli kwa luboko lwangu', naalu'a kuli'pa. Kai' ntu'pu' kitumbu sa kukuku'mbu'ki'ya panga, kasangu' wendalongelwa bu'kana na ukoto wako. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Tumbwe lelo wannongo wangu', nikulu'ba unipangi likowe li'no kwa kitumbu sa Bwana Yesu. Uupulaise mwoyo wangu', kati wannongo kwa Kilisitu.<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Panikuandikya balua yi'no niu'bi'lya panga kwo yu'wa kwako ulu'a yi'ki'tyana na nenga, na nitangite panga ulu'a gapanga ata pi'ta gano ganikulu'ba. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Pamope na ago, unibi'ki wiso pandu po ikya, kwa mwanjaa niu'bi'lya panga kwa malu'bo ginu, Nnu'ngu' alu'a nibuyanganiya kasinu.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Salamu ya kuundi'la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Epafila ywatabilwe pamope na nenga kwa kitumbu sa Kilisitu Yesu, endakusalimia. <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />Nyinyonyo Maluko, Alisitako, Dema na Luka apangakasi ayangu' bendakusalimia. <verse eid="PHM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Ngu'ngu' ya Bwana Yesu Kilisitu ibe pamope na mwenga.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>